{"id":"vd-b1-the-robot-tutor","level":"b1","n":25,"title":{"en":"I See Your Point, But…","vi":"Tớ hiểu ý cậu, nhưng…"},"summary":"Trước giờ tranh luận, Ella và Diego tập với nhau: gia sư AI có nên thay thế giáo viên không? Hai bạn đồng ý, phản bác và cuối cùng tìm được điểm chung.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-robot-tutor","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Robot Tutor","vi":"Gia sư rô-bốt"}},"scene":{"background":"classroom","props":[{"id":"laptop","x":800}]},"cast":{"ella":{"name":{"en":"Ella","vi":"Ella"},"look":"teengirl","x":520,"style":{"hair":"pigtails","hairColor":"#E0B060","outfit":"uniform","top":"#7B2D26","topShade":"#65241F"}},"diego":{"name":{"en":"Diego","vi":"Diego"},"look":"teenboy","x":1150,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#2B1B14","skin":"#C9936B","skinShade":"#B07A55","outfit":"uniform","top":"#7B2D26","topShade":"#65241F"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"ella","en":"OK, let's practice. I'll argue that AI tutors should replace teachers.","vi":"Được rồi, mình tập nhé. Tớ sẽ lập luận rằng gia sư AI nên thay thế giáo viên.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","lɛts","ˈpɹæktəs","aɪl","ˈɑɹɡju","ðæt","aɪ","ˈtutɚz","ʃʊd","ˌɹiˈpleɪs","ˈtitʃɚz"],"start":0.554,"end":6.604,"gesture":"explain","prop":"laptop","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.212],[2,1.499],[3,3.207],[4,3.493],[5,3.975],[6,4.287],[7,4.652],[8,5.173],[9,5.394],[10,5.889]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"And I'll argue against it. Go on.","vi":"Còn tớ sẽ phản bác. Cậu nói đi.","ipa":["ənd","aɪl","ˈɑɹɡju","əˈɡɛnst","ɪt","ɡoʊ","ɑn"],"start":7.394,"end":9.804,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,7.394],[1,7.492],[2,7.687],[3,8.156],[4,8.651],[5,9.341],[6,9.511]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"First, AI is always available. You can ask Max a question at midnight.","vi":"Thứ nhất, AI lúc nào cũng sẵn sàng. Cậu có thể hỏi Max lúc nửa đêm.","ipa":["fɝst","aɪ","ɪz","ˈɔlˌweɪz","əˈveɪləbəl","ju","kæn","æsk","mæks","ə","ˈkwɛstʃən","æt","ˈmɪdˌnaɪt"],"start":10.594,"end":16.794,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,10.594],[1,11.332],[2,11.762],[3,12.036],[4,12.491],[5,14.134],[6,14.342],[7,14.564],[8,14.928],[9,15.293],[10,15.384],[11,16.061],[12,16.256]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"That's true. However, most people shouldn't be studying at midnight!","vi":"Đúng vậy. Tuy nhiên, hầu hết mọi người không nên học lúc nửa đêm!","ipa":["ðæts","tɹu","ˌhaʊˈɛvɚ","moʊst","ˈpipəl","ˈʃʊdənt","bi","ˈstʌdiɪŋ","æt","ˈmɪdˌnaɪt"],"start":17.584,"end":21.554,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,17.584],[1,17.774],[2,18.633],[3,19.193],[4,19.544],[5,19.857],[6,20.208],[7,20.326],[8,20.899],[9,21.068]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"Ha! Fair enough. Second, it never gets impatient.","vi":"Ha! Cũng có lý. Thứ hai, nó không bao giờ mất kiên nhẫn.","ipa":["hɑ","fɛɹ","ɪˈnʌf","ˈsɛkənd","ɪt","ˈnɛvɚ","ɡɛts","ˌɪmˈpeɪʃənt"],"start":22.344,"end":28.114,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,22.344],[1,23.57],[2,23.96],[3,25.38],[4,26.396],[5,26.539],[6,26.969],[7,27.268]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"I see your point, but patience isn't everything. Max never notices when you're pretending.","vi":"Tớ hiểu ý cậu, nhưng kiên nhẫn không phải là tất cả. Max chẳng bao giờ nhận ra khi mình giả vờ.","ipa":["aɪ","si","jɔɹ","pɔɪnt","bʌt","ˈpeɪʃəns","ˈɪzənt","ˈɛvɹiˌθɪŋ","mæks","ˈnɛvɚ","ˈnoʊtəsəz","wɛn","jʊɹ","pɹiˈtɛndɪŋ"],"start":28.904,"end":34.384,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,28.904],[1,28.947],[2,29.156],[3,29.325],[4,29.794],[5,30.028],[6,30.575],[7,30.887],[8,31.903],[9,32.294],[10,32.606],[11,33.296],[12,33.505],[13,33.687]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"But it helped me so much with maths. My marks went up!","vi":"Nhưng nó giúp tớ rất nhiều môn toán. Điểm tớ tăng lên mà!","ipa":["bʌt","ɪt","hɛlpt","mi","soʊ","mʌtʃ","wɪð","mæθs","maɪ","mɑɹks","wɛnt","ʌp"],"start":35.174,"end":39.704,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,35.174],[1,35.314],[2,35.458],[3,35.861],[4,36.044],[5,36.395],[6,36.747],[7,36.942],[8,38.468],[9,38.715],[10,39.197],[11,39.483]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"Exactly. It helped you. It didn't replace Ms. Park.","vi":"Chính xác. Nó giúp cậu. Nó đâu có thay thế cô Park.","ipa":["ɪɡˈzæktli","ɪt","hɛlpt","ju","ɪt","ˈdɪdənt","ˌɹiˈpleɪs","mɪz","pɑɹk"],"start":40.494,"end":44.304,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,40.494],[1,41.602],[2,41.732],[3,42.058],[4,42.723],[5,42.814],[6,43.088],[7,43.622],[8,43.869]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"I'm not sure I agree. Some students can't afford private lessons. AI is cheap.","vi":"Tớ không chắc là tớ đồng ý. Có những bạn không đủ tiền học thêm. AI thì rẻ.","ipa":["aɪm","nɑt","ʃʊɹ","aɪ","əˈɡɹi","sʌm","ˈstudənts","kænt","əˈfɔɹd","ˈpɹaɪvət","ˈlɛsənz","aɪ","ɪz","tʃip"],"start":45.094,"end":52.434,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,45.094],[1,45.273],[2,45.547],[3,45.898],[4,46.055],[5,47.45],[6,47.841],[7,48.453],[8,48.778],[9,49.26],[10,49.768],[11,51.355],[12,51.85],[13,52.11]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"That's a good argument. I hadn't thought about that.","vi":"Lý lẽ hay đấy. Tớ chưa nghĩ đến điều đó.","ipa":["ðæts","ə","ɡʊd","ˈɑɹɡjəmənt","aɪ","ˈhædənt","θɔt","əˈbaʊt","ðæt"],"start":53.224,"end":56.064,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,53.224],[1,53.4],[2,53.492],[3,53.713],[4,54.768],[5,54.846],[6,55.184],[7,55.471],[8,55.809]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"So you agree with me?","vi":"Vậy cậu đồng ý với tớ à?","ipa":["soʊ","ju","əˈɡɹi","wɪð","mi"],"start":56.854,"end":58.074,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,56.854],[1,57.023],[2,57.232],[3,57.57],[4,57.792]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"Partly. AI is a great tool. But a tool shouldn't do your thinking for you.","vi":"Một phần thôi. AI là một công cụ tuyệt vời. Nhưng công cụ không nên suy nghĩ thay mình.","ipa":["ˈpɑɹtli","aɪ","ɪz","ə","ɡɹeɪt","tul","bʌt","ə","tul","ˈʃʊdənt","du","jɔɹ","ˈθɪŋkɪŋ","fɔɹ","ju"],"start":58.864,"end":63.724,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,58.864],[1,59.767],[2,60.066],[3,60.222],[4,60.3],[5,60.639],[6,61.498],[7,61.616],[8,61.707],[9,62.11],[10,62.514],[11,62.644],[12,62.84],[13,63.243],[14,63.439]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"I couldn't agree more. That's what happened with the homework.","vi":"Tớ hoàn toàn đồng ý. Đó chính là chuyện đã xảy ra với bài tập về nhà.","ipa":["aɪ","ˈkʊdənt","əˈɡɹi","mɔɹ","ðæts","wʌt","ˈhæpənd","wɪð","ðə","ˈhoʊmˌwɝk"],"start":64.514,"end":68.634,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,64.514],[1,64.618],[2,65.035],[3,65.4],[4,66.73],[5,67.094],[6,67.277],[7,67.811],[8,67.98],[9,68.071]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"Don't remind me. The average score went up, but my essay had three lines.","vi":"Đừng nhắc nữa. Điểm trung bình thì tăng, còn bài luận của tớ có đúng ba dòng.","ipa":["doʊnt","ɹiˈmaɪnd","mi","ðə","ˈævɚɪdʒ","skɔɹ","wɛnt","ʌp","bʌt","maɪ","ɛˈseɪ","hæd","θɹi","laɪnz"],"start":69.424,"end":74.434,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,69.424],[1,69.653],[2,70.173],[3,70.864],[4,70.955],[5,71.345],[6,71.723],[7,71.944],[8,72.543],[9,72.817],[10,73.038],[11,73.429],[12,73.65],[13,73.884]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"So what's our conclusion?","vi":"Vậy kết luận của mình là gì?","ipa":["soʊ","wʌts","ˈaʊɚ","kənˈkluʒən"],"start":75.224,"end":76.664,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,75.224],[1,75.459],[2,75.745],[3,75.901]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"A compromise. Use AI for practice, but keep the teachers. Can we agree on that?","vi":"Một phương án dung hoà. Dùng AI để luyện tập, nhưng giữ lại giáo viên. Mình thống nhất vậy nhé?","ipa":["ə","ˈkɑmpɹəˌmaɪz","juz","aɪ","fɔɹ","ˈpɹæktəs","bʌt","kip","ðə","ˈtitʃɚz","kæn","wi","əˈɡɹi","ɑn","ðæt"],"start":77.454,"end":82.944,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,77.454],[1,77.458],[2,78.656],[3,78.93],[4,79.281],[5,79.476],[6,80.088],[7,80.31],[8,80.583],[9,80.687],[10,81.716],[11,81.885],[12,82.055],[13,82.484],[14,82.68]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"Agreed. Now let's hope the rest of the class thinks the same.","vi":"Đồng ý. Giờ chỉ mong cả lớp cũng nghĩ giống vậy.","ipa":["əˈɡɹid","naʊ","lɛts","hoʊp","ðə","ɹɛst","ʌv","ðə","klæs","θɪŋks","ðə","seɪm"],"start":83.734,"end":88.244,"expression":"happy","react":{"diego":"happy"},"timing":[[0,83.734],[1,85.248],[2,85.586],[3,85.873],[4,86.146],[5,86.276],[6,86.641],[7,86.745],[8,86.849],[9,87.357],[10,87.683],[11,87.813]]}],"words":[{"id":"agree","en":"agree","ipa":"əˈɡɹi","vi":"đồng ý; nhất trí; tán thành","level":0},{"id":"point","en":"point","ipa":"pɔɪnt","vi":"điểm; chỉ tay; ý chính","level":0},{"id":"argue","en":"argue","ipa":"ˈɑɹɡju","vi":"tranh cãi; lập luận","level":1},{"id":"impatient","en":"impatient","ipa":"ˌɪmˈpeɪʃənt","vi":"thiếu kiên nhẫn; sốt ruột","level":1},{"id":"available","en":"available","ipa":"əˈveɪləbəl","vi":"có sẵn; sẵn có; rảnh","level":2},{"id":"replace","en":"replace","ipa":"ˌɹiˈpleɪs","vi":"thay thế; thay bằng","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Đồng ý và phản đối một cách lịch sự","pattern":"I see your point, but… · I'm not sure I agree. · That's true. However,… · I couldn't agree more. · Exactly! · Fair enough.","explain":"Phản đối lịch sự: ghi nhận trước rồi mới nêu ý khác — \"I see your point, but…\", \"That's true. However, …\". Không chắc: \"I'm not sure I agree.\" Đồng ý mạnh: \"I couldn't agree more.\", \"Exactly!\". Chấp nhận lý lẽ: \"Fair enough.\"","keys":["i see your point","i'm not sure i agree","that's true","however","i couldn't agree more","exactly","fair enough"],"lines":[3,4,5,7,8,12]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-the-robot-tutor.mp3","v":"72244ff9f7","duration":89.328,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}